{"suttaId":"an5.64","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-v","vriCode":"s0403m1.mul","paras":[541,545],"vripara":"64"},"segments":{"an5.64:0.3":"Dutiyavaḍḍhisuttaṃ","an5.64:1.1":"“Pañcahi, bhikkhave, vaḍḍhīhi vaḍḍhamānā ariyasāvikā ariyāya vaḍḍhiyā vaḍḍhati, sārādāyinī ca hoti varādāyinī ca kāyassa.","an5.64:1.2":"Katamāhi pañcahi?","an5.64:1.3":"Saddhāya vaḍḍhati, sīlena vaḍḍhati, sutena vaḍḍhati, cāgena vaḍḍhati, paññāya vaḍḍhati – imāhi kho, bhikkhave, pañcahi vaḍḍhīhi vaḍḍhamānā ariyasāvikā ariyāya vaḍḍhiyā vaḍḍhati, sārādāyinī ca hoti varādāyinī ca kāyassā”ti.","an5.64:2.1":"“Saddhāya sīlena ca yā pavaḍḍhati [yādha vaḍḍhati (sī.)],","an5.64:2.2":"Paññāya cāgena sutena cūbhayaṃ;","an5.64:2.3":"Sā tādisī sīlavatī upāsikā,","an5.64:2.4":"Ādīyatī sāramidheva attano”ti.","an5.64:2.5":"catutthaṃ;"},"attha":{"book":"Mp-v","bookName":"Pañcakanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0403a.att","from":156,"to":157,"paras":[{"para":156,"vripara":"63-64","refs":["an5.64:1"],"lines":["63-64. Tatiye <b>varādāyī</b>ti uttamassa varassa ādāyako.","Sesamettha catutthe ca uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["an5.64:1"],["an5.64:1"]]},{"para":157,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.64:1"],"lines":["Sākacchasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["an5.64:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-v","bookName":"Pañcakanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0403t.tik","from":158,"to":160,"paras":[{"para":158,"vripara":"61-65","refs":["an5.64:1"],"lines":["61-65. Dutiyassa paṭhame <b>“mahapphalā mahānisaṃsā”</b>ti ubhayampetaṃ atthato ekaṃ, byañjanameva nānanti āha <b>“mahapphalā”</b>tiādi.","“Pañcime gahapatayo ānisaṃsā”tiādīsu (udā.76) ānisaṃsa-saddo phalapariyāyopi hoti.","Mahato lokuttarassa sukhassa paccayā hontīti <b>mahānisaṃsā.</b>","<b>Amatogadhā</b>ti amatabbhantarā amataṃ anuppaviṭṭhā nibbānadiṭṭhattā, tato paraṃ na gacchanti.","Tena vuttaṃ “amatapariyosānā”ti.","Amataṃ pariyosānaṃ avasānaṃ etāsanti <b>amatapariyosānā.</b>","<b>Maraṇasaññā</b>ti maraṇānupassanāñāṇena saññā.","<b>Āhāre paṭikūlasaññā</b>ti āhāraṃ gamanādivasena paṭikūlato pariggaṇhantassa uppannasaññā.","<b>Ukkaṇṭhitassā</b>ti nibbindantassa katthacipi asajjantassa.","Dutiyādīni uttānatthāneva."],"lineRefs":[["an5.64:1"],["an5.64:1"],["an5.64:1"],["an5.64:1"],["an5.64:1"],["an5.64:1"],["an5.64:1"],["an5.64:1"],["an5.64:1"],["an5.64:1"]]},{"para":159,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Saññāsuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":160,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.64:1"],"lines":["6-10. Sājīvasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["an5.64:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
